Description: A live terminal monitor for language-model usage, quotas, and subscription
 capacity
 lmtop ("language-model top") is a terminal dashboard for monitoring usage, rate
 limits, rolling quota windows, reset times, burn velocity, and projected
 exhaustion across AI coding agents such as OpenAI Codex and Claude Code. It is
 designed especially for users on flat-rate subscription plans rather than
 API-only billing.

